@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC12 Dich thuyet minh va gan MP3

actor "Admin / SuperAdmin" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebAdminUI - MediaLibraryPage va CmsAudioPreviewPlayer" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nNarrationsController + CmsAudioPreviewController + NarrationDraftService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nAudioTrackRepository + ApplicationDbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Duyet hoac mo narration da duyet
alt Pipeline tu dong dich va tao TTS
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau xu ly tu UC11 hoac generate-audio
  Business -> Business: Kiem tra quyen, trang thai va ngon ngu active
  Business -> DataAccess: Doc draft nguon, POI, Language active va AudioTrack hien co
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc NarrationDraft, Language va AudioTrack
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra du lieu nguon
  alt Nguon va ngon ngu hop le
    Business -> Business: Tao MP3 cho ngon ngu goc bang TTS noi bo
    Business -> DataAccess: Upsert AudioTrack va gan GeneratedAudioTrack
    DataAccess -> Database: Ghi AudioTrack, TTSText va NarrationDraft AudioGenerated
    Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
    loop Moi ngon ngu active con thieu
      Business -> Business: Dich tieu de va noi dung sang ngon ngu dich
      Business -> Business: Tao MP3 bang TTS noi bo cho noi dung dich
      Business -> DataAccess: Tao hoac cap nhat NarrationDraft dich va AudioTrack
      DataAccess -> Database: Ghi NarrationDraft, AudioTrack, version va metadata audio
      Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
    end
    Business --> UI: Tra trang thai dang xu ly hoac da tao audio
    UI -> UI: Tu dong refetch danh sach thuyet minh va am thanh
  else Khong hop le hoac ngon ngu khong active
    Business --> UI: Tra thong bao loi
  end
else Admin chinh sua noi dung da co audio
  Actor -> UI: Sua text va luu
  UI -> Business: Gui noi dung moi
  Business -> Business: Lay ngon ngu vua sua lam nguon dong bo
  Business -> Business: Tao lai MP3 cho ngon ngu nguon
  Business -> DataAccess: Cap nhat NarrationDraft nguon, AudioTrack version va TTSText
  DataAccess -> Database: Ghi Status AudioGenerated, fileUrl moi, version va metadata
  Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
  loop Moi ngon ngu active khac
    Business -> Business: Dich lai title/text tu nguon moi
    Business -> Business: Tao lai MP3 cho ngon ngu dich
    Business -> DataAccess: Upsert NarrationDraft va AudioTrack
    DataAccess -> Database: Ghi Status AudioGenerated, TTSText, version va metadata
    Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
  end
  Business --> UI: Tra draft va danh sach audio moi
  UI -> UI: Lam moi bang thuyet minh, bang am thanh va preview
else TextContent bi sua ngoai trang admin
  Actor -> Database: Cap nhat TextContent trong NarrationDrafts
  Business -> DataAccess: Background scan draft co TextContent lech TTSText
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc NarrationDraft va AudioTrack
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra draft can dong bo
  Business -> Business: Dua draft vao hang doi dich/TTS
  Business -> Business: Lay ngon ngu vua sua lam nguon dong bo
  Business -> DataAccess: Cap nhat Status AudioGenerated cho tat ca ngon ngu active
  DataAccess -> Database: Ghi NarrationDraft, AudioTrack va metadata audio moi
  Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
else Tai MP3 thu cong de thay the
  Actor -> UI: Chon file MP3 cho draft da duyet
  UI -> Business: Gui file va tieu de
  Business -> Business: Kiem tra AdminOnly, file va trang thai draft
  Business -> Business: Luu tam va doc thoi luong MP3
  alt File MP3 hop le
    Business -> DataAccess: Tao/cap nhat AudioTrack va draft AudioGenerated
    DataAccess -> Database: Ghi AudioTrack va NarrationDraft
    Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
    Business --> UI: Tra narration da gan audio
  else File sai, rong, qua lon hoac khong doc duoc
    Business -> Business: Xoa file khong hop le
    Business --> UI: Tra thong bao loi
  end
end

opt Preview audio bao ve trong CMS
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau preview audio
  Business -> DataAccess: Doc AudioTrack active kem version va updatedAt
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc metadata audio
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra track
  Business --> UI: Stream MP3 bao ve trong CMS
end

UI --> Actor: Cap nhat tab audio hoac hien thi loi
@enduml
